OL,12,     Gjazz, and Iain Ballamy returns to
OL,13,     Gshare his final pick of the week.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GYoung chamber musicians perform a
OL,16,     Gselection of chamber works by
OL,17,     GSchubert in the concert hall of
OL,18,     Gthe Palau de la Musica Catalana
OL,19,     Gin Barcelona. Penny Gore presents.
